cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "oxysim-demo-cases: demonstration cases for oxysim-129"
message: >-
  If you use these cases, please cite this repository (DOI) together with the
  paper the case is based on: Nicolai et al. (2021),
  doi:10.1016/j.proci.2020.06.081 for laminar-coal, or Vahl et al. (2026),
  doi:10.1016/j.fuel.2026.138602 for turbulent-oxyfuel-biomass.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Steffens
    given-names: Pascal
  - family-names: Vahl
    given-names: Antje
  - family-names: Berkel
    given-names: Leon Loni
  - family-names: Nicolai
    given-names: Hendrik
  - family-names: Hasse
    given-names: Christian
abstract: >-
  Runnable demonstration cases for oxysim-129, an OpenFOAM-based
  flamelet/FLUT combustion framework with Lagrangian particle coupling: a
  laminar coal flat flame burner and a turbulent gas-assisted oxy-fuel
  biomass flame.
repository-code: "https://github.com/STFS-TUDa/oxysim-demo-cases"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.23218637"
date-released: "2026-10-07"
